4361?postid=16893459#post16893459"},{"id":"536732","content":"\u003Ccontent-quote data-username=\u0022Yubi\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022content-quote-content\u0022\u003E\t\u003Cdiv class=\u0022content-quote-content\u0022\u003E\t\u003Cdiv class=\u0022content-quote-content\u0022\u003E\t\u003Cp\u003EI was able to recreate the zone (I\u2019ve done it twice )\u00a0 but separation happen without reason after random time (could be a day or two)\u003C\/p\u003E\t\u003C\/div\u003E\t\u003C\/div\u003E\t\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/content-quote\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGenerate a diagnostics report with ten minutes of the next occurrence and speak to Sonos support. The report may indicate why the zone is separating.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00a0\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/support.sonos.com\/en-gb\/article\/submit-diagnostics\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003Ehttps:\/\/support.sonos.com\/en-gb\/article\/submit-diagnostics\u003C\/a\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u00a0\u003C\/p\u003E","repliedAt":"2026-07-20T14:24:12+00:00","publicReplyId":"16893466","highlighted":false,"inclusiveReplyCount":0,"inclusiveVisibleReplyCount":0,"likedBy":["7880809"],"isBestAnswer":true,"isPinnedReply":false,"authorId":"8038823","repliedAtDisplayText":"3 months ago","repliedAtTooltipText":"Jul 20, 2026 2:24 PM UTC","topLikedBy":[{"id":7880809,"url":"https:\/\/en.community.sonos.com\/members\/airgetlam-7880809","name":"Airgetlam","avatar":"https:\/\/uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com\/sonos-en\/icon\/90x90\/7aeaa938-b030-48f0-9255-2ff5caa37ba9.png"}],"attachments":[],"url":"https:\/\/en.community.sonos.com\/speakers-229128\/zone-speakers-are-separate-without-interaction-since-the-last-apps-update-6934361?postid=16893466#post16893466"},{"id":"536737","content":"\u003Cp\u003EAre you using the right term, Zone and not Group? Very different answers depending on which it is.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESupport can sort that out.\u003C\/p\u003E","repliedAt"